# The default play scene (the render test cave) with its two enemies and
# the --spawn-enemies extras, as the windowed app starts.
scene lighting
spawn 1060 1180
ticks 400
zoom 3
at 0 enemy walker 1245 1180
at 0 enemy flyer 860 1010
at 10 aimrel 80 -10
at 60 shot start
at 61 help
at 62 shot help
at 63 help
at 100 hold right
at 100 tool 1
at 130 tap primary
at 150 release right
at 170 shot fight
at 390 shot later
